SUMMARY:Deadline: Leibniz Summer Fellowships 2027 (ZZF Potsdam\, contempora
 ry history)
DESCRIPTION:The Leibniz Centre for Contemporary History Potsdam (ZZF) invit
 es applications for two Leibniz Summer Fellowships in German and/or Europe
 an (including Eastern European) history in the twentieth century.\n\nOrgan
 isation: Leibniz Centre for Contemporary History Potsdam (ZZF)\nLocation: 
 Potsdam / Berlin\, Germany. Open to international postdoctoral researchers
  residing outside Germany.\nAward: Two fellowships of EUR 3\,000 per month
  for two months (EUR 6\,000 total each)\, plus office space\, computer fac
 ilities\, specialist library access and participation in ZZF's academic co
 mmunity. No application fee.\nDuration: Two consecutive months between Apr
 il and October 2027\n\nMore: https://zzf-potsdam.de/chancen/stellenangebot
 e/leibniz-summer-fellowships-field-german-andor-european-including-eastern
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://zzf-potsdam.de/chancen/stellenangebote/leibniz-summer-fellowshi
 ps-field-german-andor-european-including-eastern?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Potsdam / Berlin\, Germany. Open to international postdoctoral res
 earchers residing outside Germany.
END:VEVENT
